  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Water takes many forms: swirling vapor, cooling liquid, piercing ice. However, although it occupies the lower energetic end of the Axis of Energy opposite fire, small streams can still become destructive tidal waves or freezing glaciers if left unregulated. Still waters run deep, so one must be cautious not to underestimate the flow of water lest they be trapped in hidden currents. \r\n\r\nWithin the effects of runes, water acts as a stabilizing substrate for the other natural elements, dampening their dangerous effects. It can be made to douse enthusiastic flames, erode the earth within its streams, and temper the air with the weight of rain. Should there be an excess of water-aligned mana however, the mana will slow to a halt and become unable to be transferred entirely, becoming frozen in place.\r\n\r\nThe Zodiac constellations commonly associated with Water are Cancer the Crab, Scorpio the Scorpion, and Pisces the Fishes. \r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0dbaabea45853494293403a1c4741dc3, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -3591927391524570855, guid: 0dbaabea45853494293403a1c4741dc3, type: 2}
